# Audit & Observability

- Every activity/gate/HITL/replan/compensation emits a canonical event
  from `event_schema.py`.
- Writer: MinIO primary, local FS fallback via circuit breaker.
- Redact PII from event payloads before write; log redaction fact only.
- Prometheus metrics: success, retry, rollback, MTTR/latency histograms.
- Correlate with `trace_id`, `run_id`, `workflow_id` on every event.
